This product includes software developed as an independent application on top of:

* Laya (https://github.com/NandhaKishorM/laya), Copyright Convai Innovations,
  licensed under the Apache License 2.0. Laya's model architecture, its RLCD training
  objective, its prompt construction and its calibration scheme are reproduced here for
